  <abstract>
    <p>
      :logo: <em>There and Back Again</em> is a <pretext />-powered personal knowledge management system developed by Eigenscribe © that demonstrates an integrated workflow for technical learning, documentation, and research.
      By separating raw derivation, conceptual synthesis, and canonical reference into distinct, interlinked layers, it serves as a living case study in networked mathematical thinking.
    </p>
